    <item>
      <title>Exposição de Pintura &#34;Aves em Canha&#34;</title>
      <link>http://example.org/events/2024-aves-em-canha/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 31 Aug 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://example.org/events/2024-aves-em-canha/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;After receiving an invitation to illustrate the book &lt;em&gt;&amp;ldquo;Memórias com Asas&amp;rdquo;&lt;/em&gt;, she&#xA;held an exhibition of the original illustrations to promote the book and the&#xA;association &lt;a href=&#34;https://circulodemajalis.com&#34;&gt;CIRCULODEMAJALIS&lt;/a&gt;. As a member of&#xA;the association, she is also one of the people responsible for the book&amp;rsquo;s&#xA;printing.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
