    <item>
      <title>Canha d&#39;Artes 2010</title>
      <link>http://example.org/events/2010-canha-dartes/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 02 Dec 2010 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://example.org/events/2010-canha-dartes/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;With the need to culturally revitalize the village of Canha, Cristina began to&#xA;organize annual collective exhibitions during the village festivals (&lt;em&gt;&amp;ldquo;Festas&#xA;de Canha&amp;rdquo;&lt;/em&gt;), inviting local artists to exhibit with her at the Canha&#xA;Ethnographic Museum.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://example.org/events/2010-canha-dartes/cartaz.png&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
